				{
					"type": "Text",
					"properties": {
						"text": "7. Click the Preview layout button. If you did correctly the previous step, the text is now saying: \"Spineboy is inside the yellow rectangle.\"\n\n6. Close the preview and click the Select animation button in the Properties section.\n   Select the walk animation. Animations do not play in the editor.\n\n7. Click the Preview layout button again. Spineboy’s walk animation is rendered correctly at runtime. The bottom white rectangle displays: \"Spineboy is playing the 'walk' animation\"\n\n8. Congratulations! You completed the first tutorial. Go the the next one.",
